    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to Frank Fux!</strong><br><br>In this daring adventure, you as Frank Fux try to using wit and jumping power to escape the depths of the dungeon and satisfy your greed.<br>Navigate Frank from platform to platform with only one direction in mind - upwards!<br>But be careful! A wrong jump can quickly send you back into the depths.<br><br><strong>The madness never ends - or does it?</strong><br><br><u>The principle sounds simple: jump and land...or fall!</u><br>- Hold the jump button to increase your jumping power and release it to jump<br>- Think carefully about where you jump - once you're in the air, the decision is final<br>- All your progress (...or regression) will be saved<br>- Reach the goal to successfully complete your adventure and make Frank happy<br><br><i>Will you manage to get to the top?</i><br><br><u>Don't be discouraged!</u><br>All beginnings are difficult - including for Frank.<br>- A fall can be frustrating, but you can learn from it!<br>- Develop a sense for the optimal jumping power to reach your goal.<br>- Climb platform by platform, but be aware of the risk. The higher you are, the deeper you can fall!<br><br><i>Don't be a wimp and don't give up!</i><br><br><br><strong>What else awaits me?</strong><br>- 2D pixel art design with cute characters and animations<br>- Pleasant, calm music - maybe it will help you get over a fall or two :)<br>- Atmospheric level<br>- Challenging gameplay with increasing thrills<br><br><br><i>Whether you make it or not depends entirely on you!</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Welcome to Frank Fux!</strong><br><br>In this daring adventure, you as Frank Fux try to using wit and jumping power to escape the depths of the dungeon and satisfy your greed.<br>Navigate Frank from platform to platform with only one direction in mind - upwards!<br>But be careful! A wrong jump can quickly send you back into the depths.<br><br><strong>The madness never ends - or does it?</strong><br><br><u>The principle sounds simple: jump and land...or fall!</u><br>- Hold the jump button to increase your jumping power and release it to jump<br>- Think carefully about where you jump - once you're in the air, the decision is final<br>- All your progress (...or regression) will be saved<br>- Reach the goal to successfully complete your adventure and make Frank happy<br><br><i>Will you manage to get to the top?</i><br><br><u>Don't be discouraged!</u><br>All beginnings are difficult - including for Frank.<br>- A fall can be frustrating, but you can learn from it!<br>- Develop a sense for the optimal jumping power to reach your goal.<br>- Climb platform by platform, but be aware of the risk. The higher you are, the deeper you can fall!<br><br><i>Don't be a wimp and don't give up!</i><br><br><br><strong>What else awaits me?</strong><br>- 2D pixel art design with cute characters and animations<br>- Pleasant, calm music - maybe it will help you get over a fall or two :)<br>- Atmospheric level<br>- Challenging gameplay with increasing thrills<br><br><br><i>Whether you make it or not depends entirely on you!</i>",
